+| 单speak | MODEL_SUPPORTED | PRODUCT_ENABLED | E0结构载体，不保证活人感收益 |
+| break | MODEL_SUPPORTED | PRODUCT_ENABLED | E0结构；NATURALNESS_VALIDATION_REQUIRED，不模板化400ms |
